  "source_notes": [
    "GEO SuperSeries GSE98815 exposes the paired weekly RNA and methylation accession order.",
    "The methylation platform is GEO GPL13534 HumanMethylation450, although individual sample metadata labels the protocol as Infinium Human MethylationEPIC; preserve this metadata discrepancy rather than silently normalizing it.",
    "Weekly molecular states are serial pooled states, not independent biological replicates.",
    "Stable resistant clones are a separate source role and may not be silently mixed into the main 22-state trajectory.",
    "GSE98812_series_matrix.txt.gz is metadata-only in the acquired public source; it is not the RNA value matrix.",
    "GSE98812_GEOExprsData.txt.gz is hash-bound but its table anatomy must be verified before state extraction.",
    "GSE98813_series_matrix.txt.gz includes the baseline plus 22 main weekly methylation states and contains a value table."
  ]
